      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_system_01",
      "hash64": "CBB201427628F5B9",
      "text": "Hace algo más de un año...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_fairyboss_01",
      "hash64": "57E0AC65E5DBDD02",
      "text": "¿Qué pasa, Anán? ¿Te ocurre algo?[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_02",
      "hash64": "B7C0872A8423728D",
      "text": "Nada... He estado hablando con la autoridad\\nsuprema, porque quería consultarme algo.\\c\\nEl caso es que hemos finiquitado la mayor parte\\nde los planes.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_honooboss_01",
      "hash64": "4BBED119DE7A8E54",
      "text": "¿Planes? ¿Qué planes?[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_03",
      "hash64": "B7C0862A842370DA",
      "text": "Para empezar, sobre la Operación Star. Y luego...\\nsobre crear un código por el que regirnos todos.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_04",
      "hash64": "B7C0812A8423685B",
      "text": "Últimamente estamos creciendo mucho con toda\\nla gente nueva que está entrando.\\c\\nLo hemos hablado y estamos de acuerdo en que\\nhace falta establecer unas normas.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 161,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_kakutouboss_01",
      "hash64": "819E7BF70D4A4EA1",
      "text": "¿Sí? ¡Qué guay! Conociéndote, fijo que se te\\nocurre algo genial.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_05",
      "hash64": "B7C0802A842366A8",
      "text": "Uf, pues yo preferiría no tener que ocuparme.\\nNo me siento nada cómodo con esto...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_06",
      "hash64": "B7C0832A84236BC1",
      "text": "Sabéis que yo fui delegado y tuve que tragarme\\nque todos se metieran conmigo por eso, ¿no?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_honooboss_02",
      "hash64": "4BBED419DE7A936D",
      "text": "¿Y qué esperabas? Te inventaste un montón de\\nnormas absurdas y quisiste colárnoslas.\\c\\n¡Normal que la gente se rebotara y te echara a\\npatadas del cargo![VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 153,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_dokuboss_01",
      "hash64": "BCA702EC8213097E",
      "text": "¡No podríais tener más razón, pardiez!\\n¿Cómo era?...\\c\\n\"El espacio entre la línea del pelo y el cuello de\\nla camisa no debe ser inferior a tres centímetros\".\\c\\nCiertamente unas normas fastidiosas y carentes\\npor completo de sentido.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 158,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 233,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_07",
      "hash64": "B7C0822A84236A0E",
      "text": "¿Pero no veis que me estáis dando la razón?\\c\\nEntonces estaréis de acuerdo en que soy la\\npersona menos indicada para la tarea, ¿no?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_fairyboss_02",
      "hash64": "57E0AB65E5DBDB4F",
      "text": "Bueno, pero tú siempre has mirado por el\\nbienestar del grupo.[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_kakutouboss_02",
      "hash64": "819E78F70D4A4988",
      "text": "Todos confiamos en ti, Anán. Sin ti, no habríamos\\nllegado donde estamos ahora.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_honooboss_03",
      "hash64": "4BBED319DE7A91BA",
      "text": "Tus días como delegado plasta son agua pasada.\\n¡Anda que no has cambiado desde entonces, tío!\\c\\nSi tú redactas las normas, hasta yo las cumpliré.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_dokuboss_02",
      "hash64": "BCA701EC821307CB",
      "text": "¡Conforme![VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_08",
      "hash64": "B7C07D2A8423618F",
      "text": "Vale, vale, de acuerdo, lo haré.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_09",
      "hash64": "B7C07C2A84235FDC",
      "text": "He hecho... lo que he podido.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_10",
      "hash64": "B7BCFF2A8420559E",
      "text": "El código dicta que ahora debo dimitir como jefe\\ndel Team Star. Yo lo redacté y tal cual lo acato.\\c\\nAcepta mi Medalla Star, que me identificaba\\ncomo jefe de escuadrón.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 169,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_waza_01",
      "hash64": "1BC1335191082461",
      "text": "Y, ya que estamos, la MT del DJ, para que no te\\nla jueguen.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_11",
      "hash64": "B7BD002A84205751",
      "text": "Supongo que la fiesta ha terminado...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_12",
      "hash64": "B7BCFD2A84205238",
      "text": "Pero oye, me quito la gorra ante tu[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]s Pokémon.\\n¡Vaya fuerza que se gasta[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]n![VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_13",
      "hash64": "B7BCFE2A842053EB",
      "text": "¿Has aprendido en la academia qué movimientos\\nenseñarle[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]s y cómo entrenarlo[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]s?[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
