    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "141F4EB4A3D0D70C",
      "text": "Perfecto. Iré al grano.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "141F4FB4A3D0D8BF",
      "text": "Al paso que vais, tenéis todas las papeletas para\\nque os expulsen de la academia.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "1422DCB4A3D3FE2D",
      "text": "¿No habéis pensado en disolver el Team Star\\ny retomar los estudios?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_23",
      "hash64": "B7B9762A841D36FC",
      "text": "¿Eso es lo que quieres saber? Pues mira, resulta\\nque estamos esperando a alguien...\\c\\nAunque no tengo muy claro si vendrá.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "1422DBB4A3D3FC7A",
      "text": "¿A alguien? ¿Algún amigo cercano, quizá?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
