    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_25",
      "hash64": "B7B9742A841D3396",
      "text": "La autoridad suprema del Team Star.\\c\\nEl equivalente a la Supercampeona para los\\nEntrenadores, para entendernos.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 113,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_26",
      "hash64": "B7B9732A841D31E3",
      "text": "La persona que nos invitó a unirnos y que fundó\\nel equipo. Por eso la llamamos así.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "1422D9B4A3D3F914",
      "text": "¿Y dónde está ahora esa autoridad suprema?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_27",
      "hash64": "B7B9722A841D3030",
      "text": "¡Eso me gustaría a mí saber! Hace ya como año\\ny medio que no nos contacta.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "1422D8B4A3D3F761",
      "text": "[EMPTY 62]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "003E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_28",
      "hash64": "B7B9812A841D49AD",
      "text": "Estaba convencido de que, si no tirábamos la\\ntoalla y manteníamos activo el Team Star, tarde\\r\\no temprano acabaría dando señales de vida...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_29",
      "hash64": "B7B9802A841D47FA",
      "text": "Pero, entre los profes dando la vara con que lo\\ndejemos ya, y aguafiestas como vosotros cada\\r\\ndos por tres...[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_15",
      "hash64": "1422D7B4A3D3F5AE",
      "text": "...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_30",
      "hash64": "B7B5F32A841A228C",
      "text": "Igual nos ha abandonado...\\c\\nEn realidad, ya había dejado caer alguna vez que\\nestaba pensando en dejarlo.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_nelke_16",
      "hash64": "1422D6B4A3D3F3FB",
      "text": "¿Y tan importantes son para ti el Team Star y esa\\nautoridad suprema?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "ajito_aku_040_akuboss_31",
      "hash64": "B7B5F42A841A243F",
      "text": "¿A ti qué te parece? Mira, como dirían los\\nestirados de la academia, para mí son...\\r\\nun tesoro.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
